	~	Dmnl
	~	(RANDOM UNIFORM ( 10 , 20 , 1000 ))/1000
	|

waste accumulation rate=
	Waste per population*Waste accumulation*Poor sanitation effect
	~	1/Month
	~		|

Risk accumulation rate=
