	~	1/Month
	~		|

Outdoor Vector Exposure=
	Aedes Suitability Index*(ChikuV Infected Aedes Adults+DengV Infected Aedes Adults+YFV Infected Aedes Adults\
		)*Infected vector occurrence
	~	
	~		|

Infected vector occurrence=
	15/24
	~	
	~		|

